WEBVTT

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:16.650
<i>There was a huge tree in the yard of my 
elementary school called the Haunted Cedar.</i>

00:00:23.770 --> 00:00:31.160
<i>But, despite its name, the tree was 
always enveloped by a warm air.</i>

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:07.480
Memories of the Haunted Cedar

00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:11.940
Your school already had its 
class reunion, Miho-chan?

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:12.850
Yeah.

00:02:12.850 --> 00:02:16.810
Although it was really just a get-together 
of the kids that could make it.

00:02:17.230 --> 00:02:18.580
Has everyone changed?

00:02:18.580 --> 00:02:20.890
Are the boys hotter?

00:02:20.890 --> 00:02:21.990
Nah.

00:02:21.990 --> 00:02:23.910
In fact, the boys were kind of more gross.

00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:27.320
That's kind of a shock.

00:02:27.890 --> 00:02:30.910
I was going to ask you to hook me up.

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:34.440
Aren't you having a class 
reunion, Sakura-chan?

00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:37.380
We haven't had ours yet.

00:02:37.380 --> 00:02:42.300
I get nostalgic about 
elementary school, though.

00:02:42.540 --> 00:02:43.560
What? Who?

00:02:43.560 --> 00:02:44.470
Your first love?

00:02:44.740 --> 00:02:47.770
No, nothing like that.

00:02:48.290 --> 00:02:50.760
Like the weird fads we had

00:02:50.760 --> 00:02:52.730
and all the strange kids there were.

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:55.630
That's what I mean: that's your first love.

00:02:58.740 --> 00:02:59.740
Mamiya-san.

00:03:00.110 --> 00:03:01.740
What's up, Tsubasa-kun?

00:03:01.970 --> 00:03:04.870
Do you have time this Sunday?

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:10.670
I buried a power stone a long time ago.

00:03:10.670 --> 00:03:14.130
I want you to come dig it up with me.

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:16.960
Power stone?

00:03:17.350 --> 00:03:18.320
Yeah.

00:03:18.320 --> 00:03:21.860
I buried it at a power spot
 to increase its spiritual power.

00:03:23.830 --> 00:03:27.180
Oh, so you're not asking her out on a date?

00:03:28.380 --> 00:03:29.770
A date?

00:03:30.340 --> 00:03:33.720
Well, I wouldn't mind, I guess.

00:03:33.720 --> 00:03:36.190
But I'm not that sleazy.

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:39.360
But why are you inviting Sakura-chan then?

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:46.120
Because that power spot is the Haunted 
Cedar at our elementary school.

00:03:46.340 --> 00:03:47.990
Really?

00:03:48.470 --> 00:03:50.620
Haunted Cedar? What's that?

00:03:51.170 --> 00:03:54.730
Mamiya-san and I first 
met in elementary school.

00:03:54.730 --> 00:03:57.210
It's a huge tree on 
the school grounds there.

00:03:57.760 --> 00:03:58.950
Oh, right.

00:03:58.950 --> 00:04:02.420
You and Sakura-chan were in 
the same elementary school.

00:04:05.720 --> 00:04:12.720
Rain or shine, Mamiya-san and I were 
always there with the Haunted Cedar.

00:04:13.970 --> 00:04:14.940
With?

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:17.150
It doesn't look too mutual.

00:04:17.550 --> 00:04:23.150
Therefore it's only natural for us 
to go back to our memorable place.

00:04:23.600 --> 00:04:28.280
<i>Rokudou, you always find a way 
to get between me and Mamiya-san,</i>

00:04:28.900 --> 00:04:34.120
<i>but we have between us a memory 
that you can never intrude in.</i>

00:04:35.190 --> 00:04:36.590
Sure, Tsubasa-kun.

00:04:36.590 --> 00:04:37.460
Let's go.

00:04:39.010 --> 00:04:40.020
Really?

00:04:40.020 --> 00:04:42.210
Yeah, it'll bring back good memories.

00:04:43.830 --> 00:04:44.760
Yes!

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:49.970
Time to get closer to Mamiya-san 
at our special place.

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:51.200
You said that out loud.

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:51.970
Yeah.

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:55.320
Sakura-chan just made a promise.

00:04:55.320 --> 00:04:56.980
Are you okay with that?

00:05:00.420 --> 00:05:01.980
It's none of my business.

00:05:02.870 --> 00:05:07.720
But... Haunted Cedar, huh? 
That's an intriguing name.

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:09.640
Looks like he's interested.

00:05:09.640 --> 00:05:10.360
Yeah.

00:05:10.770 --> 00:05:11.610
Don't come!

00:05:11.610 --> 00:05:13.270
Don't you dare come!

00:05:14.560 --> 00:05:15.710
<i>Huh?</i>

00:05:15.710 --> 00:05:18.190
<i>The base of the Haunted Cedar...</i>

00:05:18.190 --> 00:05:20.760
<i>I feel like there was something about it.</i>

00:05:20.760 --> 00:05:24.050
<i>Not about it being a power spot or anything.</i>

00:05:25.330 --> 00:05:26.450
<i>What was it?</i>

00:05:45.990 --> 00:05:47.830
It's almost time.

00:05:53.030 --> 00:05:55.040
Mamiya-san.

00:05:56.050 --> 00:05:57.160
Tsubasa-kun.

00:05:57.160 --> 00:05:58.500
Sorry, did I keep you waiting?

00:05:58.950 --> 00:06:00.520
N-Nah.

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:04.500
<i>How is this happening?</i>

00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:06.460
<i>"Sorry, did I keep you waiting?"</i>

00:06:06.460 --> 00:06:07.580
<i>It's like a date.</i>

00:06:07.580 --> 00:06:11.510
<i>No, it's not an overstatement to 
say it's </i>practically<i> a date!</i>

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:14.640
<i>I waited since morning, and it was worth it!</i>

00:06:15.210 --> 00:06:17.020
<i>So I should say...</i>

00:06:19.300 --> 00:06:21.400
I just got here, too.

00:06:22.730 --> 00:06:25.550
I haven't been to elementary 
school in such a long time.

00:06:25.550 --> 00:06:27.830
Yeah... me, too.

00:06:27.830 --> 00:06:30.880
The Haunted Cedar was on the 
school grounds, wasn't it?

00:06:30.880 --> 00:06:32.570
Let's go, Tsubasa-kun.

00:06:33.300 --> 00:06:35.580
<i>How is this happening?!</i>

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:37.230
<i>"Let's go, Tsubasa-kun."</i>

00:06:37.230 --> 00:06:38.850
<i>It's practically a date!</i>

00:06:38.850 --> 00:06:42.270
<i>No, it's not an overstatement 
to say it's </i>totally<i> a date!</i>

00:06:42.270 --> 00:06:44.880
<i>So I should say...</i>

00:06:45.100 --> 00:06:47.240
Let us proceed, Mamiya-san!

00:06:50.090 --> 00:06:52.260
Tsubasa-kun, over here.

00:06:58.000 --> 00:07:00.850
Rinne-sama, where are we going?

00:07:01.640 --> 00:07:02.970
Wherever.

00:07:04.340 --> 00:07:05.770
I'm taking a stroll.

00:07:06.630 --> 00:07:10.000
But you'll get hungry if you move.

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:13.030
Shouldn't you stay at home and be still?

00:07:13.270 --> 00:07:16.790
No. Walking will get my mind off things.

00:07:17.250 --> 00:07:19.170
I don't know.

00:07:33.300 --> 00:07:34.760
What are these markings?

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:39.930
The ground at its base looks 
suspiciously dug up, too.

00:07:42.160 --> 00:07:43.400
You there.

00:07:44.660 --> 00:07:47.400
That Haunted Cedar is cursed.

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:49.910
You shouldn't get too close to it.

00:07:50.500 --> 00:07:52.700
Cursed? what do you mean?

00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:57.330
There've been repeated cases of 
kids getting hurt around that tree.

00:07:59.230 --> 00:08:01.960
And it's dark and it takes up space.

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:05.960
We've discussed cutting it down, but...

00:08:17.800 --> 00:08:21.250
All that does is cause more 
accidents and problems.

00:08:21.250 --> 00:08:25.230
No one goes near it anymore. 
They're all afraid.

00:08:25.230 --> 00:08:26.590
No one?

00:08:26.590 --> 00:08:27.800
Yeah.

00:08:27.800 --> 00:08:30.590
So you kids better go home, too.

00:08:30.590 --> 00:08:33.240
Who knows what might happen.

00:08:33.540 --> 00:08:35.560
Just what is he talking about?

00:08:41.970 --> 00:08:44.170
It's not the same as the 
Haunted Cedar I used to know.

00:08:44.940 --> 00:08:49.590
<i>It used to feel so good to be around 
when I was in elementary school.</i>

00:08:50.730 --> 00:08:51.810
That, and...

00:08:54.570 --> 00:08:56.260
It's kind of cold.

00:08:56.760 --> 00:09:00.070
It used to be so warm.

00:09:08.520 --> 00:09:10.400
Look out, Mamiya-san.

00:09:12.190 --> 00:09:13.780
Holy Ash!

00:09:20.170 --> 00:09:24.150
You're not going to get rid 
of me with just Holy Ash.

00:09:25.800 --> 00:09:27.400
A kid evil spirit?

00:09:27.400 --> 00:09:29.840
Was it him that hurt the Haunted Cedar?

00:09:30.080 --> 00:09:32.460
Get out of here, now.

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:33.710
Or else...

00:09:33.710 --> 00:09:35.720
Or else what?

00:09:35.720 --> 00:09:36.260
Ow!

00:09:36.770 --> 00:09:39.490
You could hurt someone 
swinging that thing around.

00:09:40.890 --> 00:09:44.890
That thing stuck in the middle 
of this crazy thing...

00:09:45.130 --> 00:09:48.850
It's the power stone I buried at 
the base of the Haunted Cedar!

00:09:49.120 --> 00:09:51.360
And it's corrupt.

00:09:55.190 --> 00:09:57.150
All Over the World!

00:09:57.370 --> 00:09:58.450
Tsubasa-kun.

00:10:03.680 --> 00:10:06.680
If you don't go peacefully, 
you'll get it, too.

00:10:08.290 --> 00:10:10.960
Are you Youta-kun?

00:10:12.710 --> 00:10:14.340
What the heck?

00:10:14.340 --> 00:10:15.880
How do you know my name?

00:10:16.120 --> 00:10:17.480
I thought so.

00:10:17.480 --> 00:10:20.090
It's Youta-kun, from my 
class in elementary school.

00:10:20.540 --> 00:10:24.100
<i>He died in an accident 
in the third term of fourth grade.</i>

00:10:24.450 --> 00:10:26.350
Class 4-2, Student 21.

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:27.760
Mamiya Sakura.

00:10:27.760 --> 00:10:28.690
Do you remember me?

00:10:29.770 --> 00:10:30.690
Sakura.

00:10:31.160 --> 00:10:35.730
Bible Corner Crush!

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:38.340
<i>The Bible Corner Crush</i>

00:10:38.340 --> 00:10:43.110
<i>is a dangerous special move involving 
a blow with the corner of a Bible.</i>

00:10:43.110 --> 00:10:45.190
<i>Must only be used against spirits.</i>

00:10:45.190 --> 00:10:47.690
<i>Never use it against a living human.</i>

00:10:47.690 --> 00:10:48.750
<i>Ever!</i>

00:10:51.870 --> 00:10:55.020
You may look like a brat, but an 
evil spirit is an evil spirit.

00:10:55.020 --> 00:10:57.670
I'll send you to Hell with my Holy Ash!

00:10:57.920 --> 00:11:01.940
I can't go to the afterlife!

00:11:09.240 --> 00:11:11.230
Dog Demon!

00:11:15.870 --> 00:11:17.050
<i>It's coming back!</i>

00:11:18.040 --> 00:11:20.030
<i>No, I can't get away!</i>

00:11:24.610 --> 00:11:25.850
Rokudou-kun.

00:11:27.550 --> 00:11:29.140
It's pressing really hard.

00:11:29.140 --> 00:11:31.670
I can't purify it even 
with my Shinigami Scythe.

00:11:37.610 --> 00:11:39.790
Thanks, Rokudou-kun.

00:11:39.790 --> 00:11:40.730
Rokudou!

00:11:40.730 --> 00:11:41.800
You...

00:11:42.450 --> 00:11:43.720
You followed us?

00:11:43.970 --> 00:11:45.300
I was out on a stroll.

00:11:45.510 --> 00:11:47.450
Jeez, Rinne-sama.

00:11:47.450 --> 00:11:50.980
I was wondering why you were awkwardly 
wandering around an unfamiliar part of town.

00:11:50.980 --> 00:11:53.190
You were coming to see Sakura-sama.

00:11:53.620 --> 00:11:54.530
It's a coincidence.

00:11:54.530 --> 00:11:55.510
You're lying.

00:11:55.510 --> 00:11:56.060
Liar!

00:11:56.300 --> 00:11:58.780
Never mind that, who is he?

00:11:58.780 --> 00:12:00.650
He's really powerful for a kid.

00:12:00.860 --> 00:12:03.690
He's a classmate from elementary school.

00:12:03.690 --> 00:12:06.300
I don't know why, but he's 
become an evil spirit.

00:12:07.570 --> 00:12:09.540
Youta-kun, what's wrong?

00:12:09.540 --> 00:12:11.250
Why can't you rest?

00:12:11.570 --> 00:12:13.410
It's Mamiya Sakura's fault.

00:12:14.900 --> 00:12:17.250
Sakura is an enemy.

00:12:31.550 --> 00:12:33.310
It's all tangled again.

00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:36.020
Quadruple Moonsault.

00:12:41.220 --> 00:12:44.240
Spiral Journey Mach Five.

00:12:44.560 --> 00:12:48.420
Youta-kun was a good, youthful 
kid who was good at yoyos.

00:12:49.290 --> 00:12:50.640
Amazing.

00:12:50.640 --> 00:12:52.630
You all suck.

00:12:54.360 --> 00:12:56.420
But he would insult the kids 
who weren't good at it.

00:12:56.650 --> 00:12:58.880
Flying Fire!

00:12:59.900 --> 00:13:01.800
Youta-kun, you silly!

00:13:02.230 --> 00:13:07.210
And he would make girls cry, abusing 
his yoyo skills to flip their skirts.

00:13:07.210 --> 00:13:09.740
He was a really bad bully.

00:13:11.220 --> 00:13:14.560
Come to think of it, I vaguely 
remember him being in our class.

00:13:14.950 --> 00:13:17.580
He died after I moved away?

00:13:18.940 --> 00:13:21.420
Youta-kun, what's holding you back?

00:13:21.420 --> 00:13:23.150
Why did you become an evil spirit?

00:13:24.660 --> 00:13:26.600
It's Sakura's fault.

00:13:26.600 --> 00:13:28.660
It's her fault that I...

00:13:28.920 --> 00:13:30.210
<i>Her</i> fault?

00:13:30.210 --> 00:13:32.860
Youta, don't you recognize us?

00:13:32.860 --> 00:13:33.500
It's me!

00:13:33.780 --> 00:13:35.360
Who are you?

00:13:35.360 --> 00:13:37.210
I don't know an Itsme!

00:13:37.250 --> 00:13:38.210
Itsme

00:13:37.590 --> 00:13:38.580
Itsme...

00:13:38.580 --> 00:13:39.960
Listen to me, Youta-kun.

00:13:40.240 --> 00:13:43.260
I never said you could call my name!

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:44.970
Meteor Stream!

00:13:49.880 --> 00:13:53.750
I can't blame him for not recognizing 
Mamiya Sakura or Jumonji.

00:13:54.290 --> 00:13:58.080
That spirit's memories are 
stuck at elementary school.

00:13:58.080 --> 00:14:00.310
And meanwhile, the two of them have grown up.

00:14:00.810 --> 00:14:03.650
Damn it, I need to get the Power Stone back.

00:14:04.810 --> 00:14:06.400
Dog Demon!

00:14:11.150 --> 00:14:15.750
Damn, Youta. He's going berserk with 
the power from the power stone I buried.

00:14:16.070 --> 00:14:20.210
What are those spells he's uttering 
every time he uses his weapon?

00:14:20.450 --> 00:14:22.920
Those are yoyo trick names.

00:14:22.920 --> 00:14:26.300
They were popular in my class.

00:14:26.300 --> 00:14:28.430
Everyone did them during breaks and stuff.

00:14:28.640 --> 00:14:30.360
That's right. Sakura.

00:14:30.770 --> 00:14:33.260
Sakura always got in my way.

00:14:33.880 --> 00:14:35.890
I'll flip your skirts!

00:14:36.150 --> 00:14:38.310
Stop it, Youta-kun.

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:40.330
Meteor Stream!

00:14:42.870 --> 00:14:43.800
Who was that?!

00:14:45.050 --> 00:14:46.960
You shouldn't do that, Youta-kun.

00:14:46.960 --> 00:14:47.740
Sakura.

00:14:47.990 --> 00:14:49.430
Get out of my way!

00:14:49.430 --> 00:14:50.760
I'll make you cry.

00:14:50.760 --> 00:14:52.080
You shouldn't do that.

00:14:54.390 --> 00:14:58.040
<i>Never throw yoyos at people. It's dangerous.</i>

00:14:58.040 --> 00:14:59.210
<i>Never!</i>

00:14:59.670 --> 00:15:01.260
You're amazing, Sakura-chan.

00:15:01.260 --> 00:15:03.770
You're even better at yoyos than Youta-kun.

00:15:03.770 --> 00:15:04.940
Sure.

00:15:04.940 --> 00:15:07.890
Damn it, Sakura's full of herself.

00:15:07.890 --> 00:15:11.340
<i>And never get upset at people just 
because they're better than you.</i>

00:15:11.340 --> 00:15:12.420
<i>Never!</i>

00:15:13.060 --> 00:15:17.640
And then I tried over and 
over to make Sakura cry.

00:15:19.980 --> 00:15:20.760
You shouldn't do that.

00:15:20.760 --> 00:15:21.420
You shouldn't do that.

00:15:21.420 --> 00:15:22.310
You shouldn't do that.

00:15:24.750 --> 00:15:27.080
I got countered every time.

00:15:31.920 --> 00:15:32.950
So?

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:38.120
Don't tell me you can't rest because you 
still want to flip Mamiya-san's skirt.

00:15:38.420 --> 00:15:40.120
You vile...

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:41.710
Wait, Tsubasa-kun.

00:15:41.710 --> 00:15:43.630
Youta-kun had good qualities, too.

00:15:43.880 --> 00:15:46.200
Go straight to Hell!

00:15:46.200 --> 00:15:48.310
Holy Ash Rapid Fire!

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:52.100
That won't even get close to me.

00:15:52.100 --> 00:15:54.180
All Over the World!

00:15:55.570 --> 00:15:56.840
He knocked them away.

00:16:06.950 --> 00:16:07.900
Quit it!

00:16:10.710 --> 00:16:12.040
He's choking.

00:16:12.040 --> 00:16:13.910
What's that white smoke?

00:16:14.300 --> 00:16:17.780
Youta is likely being manipulated 
by another evil spirit.

00:16:18.420 --> 00:16:19.040
Another one?

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:22.080
Yeah, I heard another voice.

00:16:22.340 --> 00:16:24.710
It's Mamiya Sakura's fault.

00:16:25.730 --> 00:16:28.090
Sakura is an enemy.

00:16:28.740 --> 00:16:34.330
So I'm going to flush out the evil spirit 
to ask him why he really can't rest.

00:16:34.780 --> 00:16:37.230
Take this, Separation Incense!

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:48.310
Separation Incense

00:16:38.940 --> 00:16:40.330
<i>Separation Incense,</i>

00:16:40.330 --> 00:16:45.450
<i>like insecticides that repel pests 
with smoke, sends evil spirits away.</i>

00:16:45.450 --> 00:16:48.310
<i>Priced at an affordable 20 yen per can!</i>

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:53.950
There it is.

00:16:57.370 --> 00:16:58.450
Youta-kun!

00:17:04.740 --> 00:17:07.580
That's the evil spirit that 
was possessing Youta-kun.

00:17:08.570 --> 00:17:10.560
It's kind of yoyo-ish.

00:17:10.560 --> 00:17:16.630
I'm glad it's out of Youta, but my 
power stone is still fused with it.

00:17:17.360 --> 00:17:19.920
I need to get it out somehow.

00:17:20.820 --> 00:17:21.830
Boop, boop.

00:17:23.430 --> 00:17:26.810
Launchable Capsule-type Separation Incense.

00:17:27.050 --> 00:17:29.810
Order now, and get it for just 200 yen.

00:17:32.890 --> 00:17:34.060
Wait a minute.

00:17:34.060 --> 00:17:38.450
It's 20 yen per can; why is it 
200 yen? That's ten times more.

00:17:38.450 --> 00:17:39.880
200 yen, please, sir.

00:17:41.560 --> 00:17:43.620
Oy, Rokudou, explain this.

00:17:45.020 --> 00:17:46.330
200 yen, please, sir.

00:17:47.850 --> 00:17:49.290
<i>Why "please, sir"?</i>

00:17:50.740 --> 00:17:52.300
You're ripping me off!

00:17:53.750 --> 00:17:59.300
As long as I have this corrupt 
power stone, I am unstoppable!

00:17:59.610 --> 00:18:01.100
It's coming this way.

00:18:01.100 --> 00:18:02.600
Damn it.

00:18:02.600 --> 00:18:07.270
I hate to waste even 200 yen on 
that lazily-designed evil spirit,

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:09.590
but it's to protect Mamiya-san!

00:18:09.590 --> 00:18:10.980
Separation Incense!

00:18:11.240 --> 00:18:12.330
Fool!

00:18:12.330 --> 00:18:13.440
Chowtime!

00:18:13.440 --> 00:18:14.530
It ate it.

00:18:15.020 --> 00:18:15.840
Huh?

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:19.110
It's choking.

00:18:21.870 --> 00:18:22.950
It puked.

00:18:25.270 --> 00:18:26.900
My power stone.

00:18:29.640 --> 00:18:30.970
You got me!

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:34.880
Look, the evil spirit...

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:38.930
Judge a book by its cover, 
and you'll end up in deep—

00:18:42.360 --> 00:18:43.220
Purified.

00:18:50.090 --> 00:18:51.370
It's over.

00:19:04.560 --> 00:19:09.190
It's not uncommon for an evil spirit to 
come to a power spot and cause trouble.

00:19:10.060 --> 00:19:13.290
The Haunted Cedar was a victim of that.

00:19:13.670 --> 00:19:19.300
On top of that, it dug up the power 
stone that I happened to leave there,

00:19:19.550 --> 00:19:23.800
corrupted it, and used it as a power-up.

00:19:24.070 --> 00:19:29.040
Then Youta-kun was stuck here being 
manipulated by that evil spirit?

00:19:29.040 --> 00:19:33.810
No, I think Youta chose to be 
here at the Haunted Cedar.

00:19:34.440 --> 00:19:39.870
Even after the evil spirit is 
gone, Youta refuses to leave.

00:19:42.180 --> 00:19:43.430
<i>I remember now.</i>

00:19:43.960 --> 00:19:46.700
<i>Soon after Youta-kun died...</i>

00:19:47.460 --> 00:19:48.440
See you.

00:19:48.440 --> 00:19:49.780
Bye-bye.

00:19:52.610 --> 00:19:53.690
Huh?

00:19:53.690 --> 00:19:55.140
<i>I saw him there.</i>

00:19:55.760 --> 00:19:59.710
<i>He was standing at the base of 
the Haunted Cedar, just like now.</i>

00:20:00.570 --> 00:20:01.770
Youta-kun.

00:20:03.170 --> 00:20:07.780
<i>Youta-kun vanished with a hurried 
look on his face, and that was it.</i>

00:20:09.890 --> 00:20:13.480
Youta-kun, is there something here?

00:20:14.050 --> 00:20:17.610
I was sure I buried it here by the marking.

00:20:17.610 --> 00:20:20.610
Here

00:20:20.930 --> 00:20:25.570
This is the marking I left 
when I buried my power stone.

00:20:25.570 --> 00:20:26.120
Huh?

00:20:26.120 --> 00:20:31.870
Here

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:31.060
Umm, there's a similar 
marking on the other side.

00:20:31.060 --> 00:20:31.870
Huh?!

00:20:32.100 --> 00:20:35.920
<i>Was it something you buried 
that was holding you back?</i>

00:20:35.920 --> 00:20:37.280
I wonder...

00:20:37.280 --> 00:20:38.900
Let's try digging.

00:20:40.710 --> 00:20:42.410
There's something here.

00:20:45.510 --> 00:20:48.350
It's the yoyo I thought I'd lost.

00:20:48.590 --> 00:20:51.610
I was upset because 
I couldn't win against Sakura.

00:20:51.610 --> 00:20:54.470
So I thought I'd hide it for a short while.

00:20:55.120 --> 00:20:57.220
You were trying to give it back?

00:21:03.920 --> 00:21:05.640
It broke.

00:21:05.640 --> 00:21:08.270
Jeez, you suck.

00:21:08.270 --> 00:21:09.890
My yoyo.

00:21:10.860 --> 00:21:12.190
Here, have it.

00:21:12.650 --> 00:21:14.820
I have a new one already.

00:21:16.060 --> 00:21:19.380
Also, you should use your wrist.

00:21:19.380 --> 00:21:21.550
Otherwise, it won't come back.

00:21:23.160 --> 00:21:24.530
What?

00:21:24.530 --> 00:21:25.760
Stop looking.

00:21:28.470 --> 00:21:32.750
<i>Yeah, Youta-kun was actually 
a really good boy.</i>

00:21:32.750 --> 00:21:35.580
I wonder if Sakura's angry.

00:21:35.580 --> 00:21:37.320
She's not angry.

00:21:37.840 --> 00:21:39.830
I'll give this to her.

00:21:39.830 --> 00:21:40.900
Really?

00:21:40.900 --> 00:21:41.900
Yeah.

00:21:43.180 --> 00:21:44.120
Thanks.

00:22:07.730 --> 00:22:11.860
I bet he had a crush on you, Sakura-sama.

00:22:12.760 --> 00:22:14.740
I knew it the whole time.

00:22:14.740 --> 00:22:16.440
Of course he did.

00:22:18.210 --> 00:22:22.700
Say, uh, should I pay you back 
for helping me with the exorcism?

00:22:23.840 --> 00:22:25.450
Don't worry about it.

00:24:01.040 --> 00:24:25.980
Next Episode:
Curse of the Power Stone

00:24:01.480 --> 00:24:05.540
You finally dug up that power 
stone. Too bad it turned dark.

00:24:05.540 --> 00:24:08.540
As long as you're safe, nothing else matters.

00:24:08.540 --> 00:24:11.800
That power stone, though, 
what is it used for?

00:24:11.800 --> 00:24:13.010
Silence, Rokudou.

00:24:13.010 --> 00:24:14.950
I don't need to tell you.

00:24:14.950 --> 00:24:15.970
Really?

00:24:16.260 --> 00:24:18.190
I'm actually kind of curious, too.

00:24:18.190 --> 00:24:19.650
Well...

00:24:19.650 --> 00:24:22.810
Next time on <i>Rin-ne</i>:
"Curse of the Power Stone."

00:24:22.810 --> 00:24:25.980
Sorry, you'll have to wait until 
next week for the details.
